  "question": {
    "text": "A particle starts from the origin at time <math><mi>t</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math> and moves along the positive <math><mi>x</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">-</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"></mi></math>axis. The graph of velocity with respect to time is shown in figure. What is the position of the particle at time <math><mi>t</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>5</mn><mi>s</mi><mo>?</mo></math><br /><br /><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/pxvufwtwyujovtfnzqgtswfauimvemxwvcubmboaebtveorquc.png\" />",
